    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170046/4901700460010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あのさ雛菜、\r\n俺の意見なんて本当に参考になるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700460020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……へ～～～、明日までにクリスマスデートコーデ、\r\n提出しなきゃなんでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170046/4901700460020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに『私のイチオシ！　クリスマスデートコーデ』\r\nっていう、雑誌の企画だけど──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が一緒に選んでいいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700460030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……雛菜がひとりで選んじゃったら\r\n雛菜がすき～って思う服しか選ばないでしょ～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170046/4901700460030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700460040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、デートで着ていくなら……\r\nかわいい～って思ってもらえる服の方がいいよね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170046/4901700460040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700460050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だから、プロデューサーにも選んでもらう～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170046/4901700460050"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
